{
  "topic": "What if the Sun vanished?",
  "voice": "am_michael",
  "duration": 54,
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "What if the Sun vanished?",
      "speed": 1.02,
      "scene": "cosmos",
      "pause": 0.25,
      "rawDuration": 1.5786666666666667,
      "audio": "assets/voice/00.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "For about eight minutes and twenty seconds,",
      "speed": 0.92,
      "scene": "city",
      "pause": 0.06,
      "rawDuration": 2.517333333333333,
      "audio": "assets/voice/01.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "you'd notice nothing.",
      "speed": 0.92,
      "scene": "city",
      "pause": 0.18,
      "rawDuration": 1.4506666666666668,
      "audio": "assets/voice/02.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sunlight already in space",
      "speed": 0.95,
      "scene": "light",
      "pause": 0.03,
      "rawDuration": 1.856,
      "audio": "assets/voice/03.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "would still be racing toward Earth.",
      "speed": 0.95,
      "scene": "light",
      "pause": 0.2,
      "rawDuration": 2.1333333333333333,
      "audio": "assets/voice/04.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Then daylight would end.",
      "speed": 0.93,
      "scene": "dark",
      "pause": 0.3,
      "rawDuration": 1.728,
      "audio": "assets/voice/05.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "In this impossible thought experiment,",
      "speed": 0.98,
      "scene": "orbit",
      "pause": 0.05,
      "rawDuration": 2.368,
      "audio": "assets/voice/06.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "changes in gravity also travel at light speed.",
      "speed": 0.96,
      "scene": "orbit",
      "pause": 0.15,
      "rawDuration": 3.584,
      "audio": "assets/voice/07.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Earth would leave its solar orbit,",
      "speed": 0.96,
      "scene": "orbit",
      "pause": 0.05,
      "rawDuration": 1.9626666666666666,
      "audio": "assets/voice/08.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "moving roughly along a tangent.",
      "speed": 0.94,
      "scene": "orbit",
      "pause": 0.2,
      "rawDuration": 2.176,
      "audio": "assets/voice/09.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "But we wouldn't instantly freeze.",
      "speed": 0.96,
      "scene": "heat",
      "pause": 0.1,
      "rawDuration": 2.026666666666667,
      "audio": "assets/voice/10.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oceans and atmosphere store heat.",
      "speed": 0.94,
      "scene": "heat",
      "pause": 0.16,
      "rawDuration": 2.368,
      "audio": "assets/voice/11.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Without sunlight, photosynthesis would stop,",
      "speed": 0.96,
      "scene": "ice",
      "pause": 0.08,
      "rawDuration": 3.072,
      "audio": "assets/voice/12.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "and the surface would keep cooling.",
      "speed": 0.94,
      "scene": "ice",
      "pause": 0.28,
      "rawDuration": 1.9413333333333334,
      "audio": "assets/voice/13.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Now the twist.",
      "speed": 0.94,
      "scene": "vent",
      "pause": 0.24,
      "rawDuration": 1.28,
      "audio": "assets/voice/14.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Life",
      "speed": 0.94,
      "scene": "vent",
      "pause": 0.035,
      "word": true,
      "rawDuration": 0.7466666666666667,
      "audio": "assets/voice/15.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "could",
      "speed": 0.94,
      "scene": "vent",
      "pause": 0.035,
      "word": true,
      "rawDuration": 0.6826666666666666,
      "audio": "assets/voice/16.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "survive.",
      "speed": 0.94,
      "scene": "vent",
      "pause": 0.18,
      "word": true,
      "rawDuration": 1.0026666666666666,
      "audio": "assets/voice/17.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Around seafloor vents, some microbes",
      "speed": 0.94,
      "scene": "microbes",
      "pause": 0.04,
      "rawDuration": 2.7306666666666666,
      "audio": "assets/voice/18.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "use chemical energy instead of sunlight.",
      "speed": 0.92,
      "scene": "microbes",
      "pause": 0.15,
      "rawDuration": 3.029333333333333,
      "audio": "assets/voice/19.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Earth's internal heat wouldn't disappear",
      "speed": 0.96,
      "scene": "core",
      "pause": 0.02,
      "rawDuration": 1.8986666666666667,
      "audio": "assets/voice/20.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "with the Sun.",
      "speed": 0.96,
      "scene": "core",
      "pause": 0.2,
      "rawDuration": 1.1306666666666667,
      "audio": "assets/voice/21.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "Our world could lose its star,",
      "speed": 0.94,
      "scene": "ending",
      "pause": 0.16,
      "rawDuration": 2.0906666666666665,
      "audio": "assets/voice/22.wav"
    },
    {
      "text": "without immediately losing every living thing.",
      "speed": 0.92,
      "scene": "ending",
      "pause": 0.6,
      "rawDuration": 3.050666666666667,
      "audio": "assets/voice/23.wav"
    }
  ]
}
